# Settings for scout's Python service. Copy this file to .env and fill it in:
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#   uv run --env-file .env scout-server      (or scout-simulate maya leo ...)
#
# .env is git-ignored. Never commit real keys. Leave a line commented out
# rather than empty: an empty value counts as set.

# Required. Claude: https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Optional. Used only when ANTHROPIC_API_KEY isn't set: scout then runs on
# OpenAI instead. https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
# OPENAI_API_KEY=

# Optional. Google Places API (New), for on-trip recommendations: a Google
# Cloud key with Places API (New) enabled and billing on. Without it, scout
# says it can't recommend places yet.
GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=

# Optional. SerpApi, for live Google Flights fares on the flight card:
# https://serpapi.com/manage-api-key. Each flight search uses one search
# credit per home city. Without it, scout sends flight search links instead.
# SERPAPI_API_KEY=

# Optional. Where scout keeps its SQLite database. Defaults to scout.db.
# SCOUT_DB_PATH=scout.db

# Optional. The port scout listens on (always 127.0.0.1). Defaults to 8787.
# If you change it, set SCOUT_URL in bridge/.env to match.
# SCOUT_PORT=8787
